    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.poster.avif?t=1726157048\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.webm?t=1726157048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.mp4?t=1726157048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beyond reason is a knowledge-based time-loop game about surviving a tiny open world. Master your hostile environment through a variety of items, weapons, and infinitely stacking upgrades. Use each loop to uncover more of the island's mysteries, as your knowledge of the world is the only thing you keep when time begins again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a small but dense open world and uncover the mystery of its time loop<br></li><li> Fluid first person combat, using a variety of items, weapons, spells, and more<br></li><li> Break the game's boundaries through infinitely stacking power-ups<br></li><li> A quirky, fully voice-acted cast of characters<br></li><li> A short experience designed to be finished in around 2 hours</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.poster.avif?t=1726157048\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.webm?t=1726157048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950150/extras/85890b4b91d6704c27f26c9d4e0a821c.mp4?t=1726157048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beyond reason is a knowledge-based time-loop game about surviving a tiny open world. Master your hostile environment through a variety of items, weapons, and infinitely stacking upgrades. Use each loop to uncover more of the island's mysteries, as your knowledge of the world is the only thing you keep when time begins again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a small but dense open world and uncover the mystery of its time loop<br></li><li> Fluid first person combat, using a variety of items, weapons, spells, and more<br></li><li> Break the game's boundaries through infinitely stacking power-ups<br></li><li> A quirky, fully voice-acted cast of characters<br></li><li> A short experience designed to be finished in around 2 hours</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Beyond reason is a knowledge-based time-loop game about surviving a tiny open world. Master fluid first person combat, while uncovering the island's secrets. When you die, you take nothing but your knowledge of the world into the next loop.",
